; A block whose one fix names its own projected coordinate system, and no
; *cs out anywhere. A region solve under a frame reads it fine; cavern run
; over this file alone needs an output system to convert the fix into.
*begin ridge
*cs UTM48N
*fix e1 500200 3000000 100
*data normal from to tape compass clino
e1 e2 10 0 0
e2 e3 12 90 -5
*end ridge
